| Problem | Possible reason | Solution |
| Node NotReady | CNI not installed | Install CNI |
| kubeadm init fails | Swap enabled | Disable swap or configure supported swap behavior |
| containerd not running | Configuration issue | Check containerd logs |
| Worker cannot join | Network connectivity issue | Verify private IP and ports |
| Connection refused 6443 | API Server unavailable | Check Control Plane |
| CoreDNS Pending | CNI unavailable | Verify CNI |
| ImagePullBackOff | Image pull issue | Check image name and network |
| CrashLoopBackOff | Application issue | Inspect logs |
| kubelet restarting | Initialization incomplete or configuration issue | Check kubelet logs |
| Worker NotReady | Runtime or networking issue | Inspect kubelet and CNI |

Important troubleshooting commands
Check kubelet logs
sudo journalctl -u kubelet -f

Check containerd logs
sudo journalctl -u containerd -f

Check running containers
sudo crictl ps -a

Check running Pods
kubectl get pods -A

Inspect a Pod
kubectl describe pod POD_NAME

View application logs
kubectl logs POD_NAME

Check node conditions
kubectl describe node NODE_NAME

Check API Server connectivity
nc -zv MASTER_PRIVATE_IP 6443
